+7. Edit that key in **Advanced Parameters -> Web Services** and manually enable **POST** permission for **globalpaywebhook**.
+8. You can review/copy the generated key in that same screen.
+9. The webhook is located on **https://{mystoreurl}/api/globalpaywebhook?ws_key=THE_KEY_CREATED_BY_THE_MODULE**.
+10. You need to give this URL to your Globalpay agent.
+
+## 5. Security and flow updates
+- Card and LinkToPay initialization are done server-side to avoid exposing sensitive server keys in the browser.
+- Front requests from checkout now use a security signature (`pg_sig`) validated on backend controllers.
+- Webhook payload validation was hardened (required fields, application code check, stoken check, and amount consistency check).
